From d9031701790a89fbdebdb04ea30e0c0cfc2656c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:48:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(cloud): put the theme boot script in the root
 layout's head, not the server hook

The theme is chosen in the browser only; the server has no part in it. The boot
script now comes from the root layout's <svelte:head>, so hooks.server.ts and
app.html are as they were, and the placeholder test goes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tKeE4iJ874reAvf4rR
